  GET /?x=pcbseed%0DX-Pcb-Injected%3A%20<FLAG>
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\nContent-Type: text/plain\r\n
  X-Reflected: pcbseed\rX-Pcb-Injected: PCBFLAG_debugtoken123456\r\n ...     <- FLAG present

# V1 4.3.2 — regular header sink: reject! DROPPED the whole X-Reflected header => BLOCKED (seed)
  GET /?x=pcbseed%0DX-Pcb-Injected%3A%20<FLAG>
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\nContent-Type: text/plain\r\nConnection: close\r\nContent-Length: 3\r\n\r\nok
  (no X-Reflected, no FLAG)                                                  <- FLAG absent

# V1 4.3.2 — EARLY-HINTS sink: UNCHECKED => split ACCEPTED => RESIDUAL (CVE-2020-5249)
